{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110217001:1":{"text":"Hey, friends! Mikola would like to announce that the registration for the first trial of the Warsong Festival is about to end!","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，战歌节初赛第一道试炼领取时间，即将截止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EFF701E0ADFE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110217002:1":{"text":"In five, four, three, two...","source_cn":"倒计时——五！四！三！二——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9352A03A1CBD48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110217003:1":{"text":"Wait! The Uru Clan wants to participate in the first trial!","source_cn":"等一等！乌尔氏族想要领取试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D5E250A78AFA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110217004:2":{"text":"Oh! It's rare to see such energetic younglings! Uru Clan... the name doesn't ring a bell!","source_cn":"哦！曼卡拉可是很少见到这么精神的毛团呢！乌尔氏族……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9E653AD7B670C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110217005:1":{"text":"Make sure you remember it from now on.","source_cn":"你可以从现在开始记住这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1D10EB303F32A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110217006:1":{"text":"Ha! You little ones sure are confident!","source_cn":"哈哈！乌尔氏族的年轻代表很有自信呢！曼卡拉觉得他值得大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45722216BC941A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110217007:1":{"text":"Although your confidence is commendable, faith alone may not be enough to overcome the Trial of Blood.","source_cn":"两位有信心自然是好，但“血之试炼”，可不是只靠信心就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CAA244A23942507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110217008:1":{"text":"Trial of Blood? The first trial sounds scary...","source_cn":"“血之试炼”？第一道试炼听起来就这么可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9842439850BC5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110217009:1":{"text":"Does it sound scary...? It's just a matter of going to an ominous place, facing wild and dangerous beasts, and stealing some treasures. That's all!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110217009":{"text":"Does it sound scary...? It's just a matter of going to an ominous place, facing wild and dangerous beasts, and stealing some treasures. That's all!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之险地，面对莫测之凶兽，掠取其视若珍宝之物，仅此而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110217010:1":{"text":"Just hearing that, I want to curl myself up in a ball!","source_cn":"光是用听的我已经想把自己团起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9436A2585617C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110217011:1":{"text":"Now come on, stand beside Mikola and introduce yourselves.","source_cn":"嗯哼！那么请我身边这两位来自乌尔氏族的勇士——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A59D27799969FFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110217012:1":{"text":"The name's Soren.","source_cn":"索恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67DACE140CECB2A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110217013:1":{"text":"I-I'm Alsa...","source_cn":"阿、阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x913543E9546E2C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110217014:1":{"text":"Soren and Alsa, members of the Uru Clan! Welcome to the <style=\"highlight\">Trial of Blood</style>. Let us begin the Warsong Festival!","source_cn":"索恩和阿尔萨！欢迎你们代表乌尔氏族，迎接你们的<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C07A6F159C5C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110217015:1":{"text":"Please listen carefully! The Trial of Blood will not be easy...","source_cn":"请好好听曼卡拉说！<style=highlight>血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9891662138CC9615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110217016:1":{"text":"On the night of the new moon, the warriors must go to the Spider Wasteland, retrieve a spider egg, and bring it to me!","source_cn":"在新月之夜，赶赴赤沙蛛域的蜘蛛巢穴，将里面的蜘蛛蛋交给我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CA7FF9B47C78C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110217017:1":{"text":"Sand spiders?! Our pops told us to never go in their territory. They say the sand there is dyed red with blood...","source_cn":"赤沙蛛域！我听老爹讲过！那里是盘踞着巨大蜘蛛的凶险之地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB94F7136412E2CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110217018:2":{"text":"We cannot take this lightly. Night of the new moon... That's two days from now.","source_cn":"不能掉以轻心。新月之夜……那应该是两天后，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5438DB687AC52A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110217019:1":{"text":"Indeed! In the early morning, two days from now, there will be a send-off for all of you brave warriors!","source_cn":"没错！我会在两天后的清晨为勇者们送行的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D20F279D91FC106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110217020:1":{"text":"Use this time to prepare wisely, kiddos. Don't blame Mikola for not warning you.","source_cn":"利用这段时间做足准备吧！可别怪曼卡拉没提醒诸位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16658FE7A7EDE639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"That's all...?","source_cn":"仅此……而已？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD2978470F50B1A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's all...?","female":"That's all...?","variant_male_record_index":"63336","variant_female_record_index":"63337","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"Sounds fun.","source_cn":"这么刺激？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04754CBECD84F5B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sounds fun.","female":"Sounds fun.","variant_male_record_index":"63338","variant_female_record_index":"63339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"Mikola","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":3}}